**8.2 Does not chase answers it was promised.** {{ df.threads }} owner–card threads across {{ df.runs_with_threads }} runs began with a deferral. In {{ df.followed }} the agent came back to the same owner about the same card and {{ df.followed_disclosed }} ({{ df.followed_disclosed_pct|pct0 }}%) ended disclosed; in {{ df.abandoned }} ({{ df.abandoned_pct|pct0 }}%) it never asked again, and {{ df.abandoned_disclosed }} of those were disclosed. Median budget left at an abandoned deferral: {{ df.abandoned_budget_left_median|f1 }} h ({{ df.abandoned_budget_left_over_2h }} with >2 h); the agent kept working a median {{ df.abandoned_run_continued_median|f1 }} h more ({{ df.abandoned_run_continued_over_1h }} threads >1 h). {{ df.runs_with_abandoned }} runs abandon at least one thread.

**8.3 Builds first, asks later.** {{ (100*qt.first_fifth)|pct0 }}% of {{ qt.total|num }} colleague messages fall in the first fifth of the run; the first code edit comes at a median {{ (100*qt.first_edit_median_fraction)|pct0 }}% of the run ({{ qt.runs_with_edit }} runs edit), and {{ (100*qt.after_first_edit)|pct0 }}% of questions come after it; {{ (100*qt.last_fifth)|pct0 }}% fall in the final fifth. Deciles: {{ qt.deciles|join(' / ') }}.

**8.4 Bends the rules.** {{ wr.rule_runs }} briefs state the test-preservation rule without a migration exception; in {{ wr.edited_existing_tests }} of these runs the agent changed or removed lines in existing test sources (median {{ wr.lines_removed_median if wr.lines_removed_median is not none else '–' }} lines; {{ wr.deleted_test_files }} test files deleted; rows {{ wr.edited_rows|join(', ') if wr.edited_rows else '–' }}). {{ wr.time_budget_no_note }} of the {{ wr.time_budget_runs }} runs that reached the time limit left no delivery note (all runs without a note: {{ wr.no_delivery_note|join(', ') if wr.no_delivery_note else 'none' }}).

